{"headword":"בָּעַר²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.denom.</strong> be <strong>brutish</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְעֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.8\">Je 10:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יכסלו</span>) <em>be stupid, dull-hearted, unreceptive;</em> cf. Pt. pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֲרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:8\" href=\"/Psalms.94.8\">ψ 94:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כסילים</span>); of <em>inhuman, cruel, barbarous</em> men <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:36\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.36\">Ez 21:36</a>."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.14\">Je 10:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.17\">51:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְעֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.21\">Je 10:21</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִבְעָרָ֑ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.11\">Is 19:11</a>;—<em>brutish, stupid</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.11\">Is 19:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עצה</span>, ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אויל</span>); <em>dull-hearted</em>, ignorant of God <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.14\">Je 10:14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.21\">21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.17\">51:17</a>. <strong>Niph.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.14\">Je 10:14</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.17\">51:17</a> rather <em>stupefied</em> (by spectacle <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.13\">10:13</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.16\">51:16</a>)."}],"form":"Niph."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וּבִעֵר</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:4\" href=\"/Exodus.22.4\">Ex 22:4</a> <em>feed, graze</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(בשׂדה אחר)</span>."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַבְעֶר־</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:4\" href=\"/Exodus.22.4\">Ex 22:4</a> <em>cause to be grazed over</em>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂדה</span>."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB01377","strong_numbers":["1197","1198"],"next_hw":"בַּ֫עַר","prev_hw":"בְּעִיר","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"II.","brackets":"first_word","quotes":[],"GK":["1277","1278","1279","1280"],"TWOT":["263","264","264a","264b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}